{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03648",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 3.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.37,
      "end_seconds": 10.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.7,
      "end_seconds": 14.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.33,
      "end_seconds": 19.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.58,
      "end_seconds": 24.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a dry cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.6,
      "end_seconds": 30.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Right, which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 31.39,
      "end_seconds": 43.57,
      "duration_seconds": 12.18,
      "text": "It's iron tablets, once a day for my blood count, doctor. She is on Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.47,
      "end_seconds": 47.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 49.14,
      "end_seconds": 56.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "For about a year. Mm, she takes metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.61,
      "end_seconds": 60.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 61.85,
      "end_seconds": 63.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "For nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.27,
      "end_seconds": 76.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.19,
      "end_seconds": 81.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Ah, uh, I'd say three days, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 82.48,
      "end_seconds": 86.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "I think it's been nearer five days, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.54,
      "end_seconds": 91.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to five days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.69,
      "end_seconds": 94.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "That sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.5,
      "end_seconds": 105.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "Right, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.89,
      "end_seconds": 123.24,
      "duration_seconds": 16.35,
      "text": "It's a few times a day. About a six out of ten. Sorry, uh, I know I'm rambling a bit. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.79,
      "end_seconds": 130.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "And, And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 131.02,
      "end_seconds": 137.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, um, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.73,
      "end_seconds": 141.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.09,
      "end_seconds": 144.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Have you had sore ankles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.48,
      "end_seconds": 147.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Yes, that started yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.27,
      "end_seconds": 151.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.6,
      "end_seconds": 154.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Honestly, every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.96,
      "end_seconds": 159.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.64,
      "end_seconds": 161.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Severe, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.97,
      "end_seconds": 162.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.89,
      "end_seconds": 168.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "I had tiredness before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.78,
      "end_seconds": 174.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Have you had a dry cough before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.7,
      "end_seconds": 180.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 182.28,
      "end_seconds": 184.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.33,
      "end_seconds": 188.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Any weight loss or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.81,
      "end_seconds": 194.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "I, I haven't had weight loss or coughing up blood, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.46,
      "end_seconds": 198.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Did you get fever or night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.98,
      "end_seconds": 206.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.36,
      "end_seconds": 215.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.98,
      "end_seconds": 218.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.74,
      "end_seconds": 224.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.73,
      "end_seconds": 239.7,
      "duration_seconds": 13.97,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.65,
      "end_seconds": 246.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.83,
      "end_seconds": 250.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Well, I've had low haemoglobin, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.08,
      "end_seconds": 252.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.66,
      "end_seconds": 259.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "An underactive thyroid, for about a year. I've got an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.87,
      "end_seconds": 269.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.57,
      "end_seconds": 276.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, my grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.4,
      "end_seconds": 295.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.41,
      "end_seconds": 299.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.13,
      "end_seconds": 305.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.66,
      "end_seconds": 313.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.4,
      "end_seconds": 318.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.85,
      "end_seconds": 327.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "I had part of my thyroid removed years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.39,
      "end_seconds": 331.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.17,
      "end_seconds": 342.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.83,
      "end_seconds": 369.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 111 over 74, pulse 65, respiratory rate 17, saturation 99 percent, temp 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.15,
      "end_seconds": 372.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.82,
      "end_seconds": 376.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.39,
      "end_seconds": 383.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Okay, I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.24,
      "end_seconds": 386.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.29,
      "end_seconds": 402.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "There are tender raised red nodules on both shins and your ankles are puffy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 407.36,
      "end_seconds": 416.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like possible sarcoidosis. Another possibility is tuberculosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 417.14,
      "end_seconds": 420.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.91,
      "end_seconds": 441.14,
      "duration_seconds": 19.23,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like possible sarcoidosis, but I'd like to confirm. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with possible sarcoidosis. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 442.87,
      "end_seconds": 447.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "We have a slot Tuesday at 2 pm, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 448.44,
      "end_seconds": 451.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Okay, um, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.43,
      "end_seconds": 483.51,
      "duration_seconds": 31.08,
      "text": "I'm going to order a chest X-ray, for cough and erythema nodosum. Rest and elevate the legs, and I'm arranging a chest clinic review. Let's get you seen by the respiratory clinic, I'll arrange the letter. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 484.29,
      "end_seconds": 487.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}